README.md-6-## Project timeline
README.md-7-
README.md-8-- [2026-09-01] Restored the array-aware front-door static routing from provenance commit `2e2b47f` into the `6bd3a5d` MAIN line after checkpoint `46698f5` omitted it. The canonical route state remains unchanged; ordered static fallback and shared backend connection reuse are covered by continuity tests.
README.md:9:- [2026-09-01] Production safety correction: pinned `/clone-a` to the already-running prefix-safe generation on `3041`, preserving the existing public identity, stable `clone-a` OAuth store, and shared process receipts. `3051` is quarantined as rollback evidence and must not be restored without new end-to-end connector proof. The switch itself and subsequent `start_process`/`read_output` calls completed successfully.
README.md:10:- [2026-09-01] SUPERSEDED: an earlier same-day attempt moved clone routes to `3011/3012`; that decision was later invalidated by live connector evidence and must not be treated as the production route.
README.md-11-- [2026-09-01] Re-proved the stable-front-door clone topology: Funnel must expose only the root handler to port 3003; clone paths must reach 3003 intact and be dispatched by its static route map. Separate Tailscale --set-path /clone-* handlers strip the prefix and break clone OAuth/routing. Public /clone-b passed four consecutive authenticated process-profile smoke runs through 3003 -> 3042 after removing its separate Funnel handler.
README.md-12-- [2026-09-01] Isolated the default smoke test from `.env` and live public generations: `npm test` now launches a disposable loopback backend, while direct external smoke runs require an explicit origin and opt-in flag.
