CHANGELOG.md-3-- [2026-09-01] Restored the array-aware front-door static routing from provenance commit `2e2b47f` into the `6bd3a5d` MAIN line after checkpoint `46698f5` omitted it. The canonical route state remains unchanged; ordered static fallback and shared backend connection reuse are covered by continuity tests.
