CHANGELOG.md:5:- [2026-09-01] Production safety correction: pinned `/clone-a` to the already-running prefix-safe generation on `3041`, preserving the existing public identity, stable `clone-a` OAuth store, and shared process receipts. `3051` is quarantined as rollback evidence and must not be restored without new end-to-end connector proof. The switch itself and subsequent `start_process`/`read_output` calls completed successfully.
